{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25404","headline":"奉送相公十八丈镇杨州 · 李德裕","name":"奉送相公十八丈镇杨州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"千骑风生大斾舒，春江重到武侯庐。\n共悬龟印衔新绶，同忆鱣庭访旧居。\n取履桥边啼鸟换，钓璜溪畔落花初。\n今来却笑临邛客，入蜀空驰使者车。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25404.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25404","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}